        "difficulty": "Moderate",
        "featured_guide": true,
        "introduction": "When a hedge or plant has grown taller than the sprinkler head’s spout can spray, grass beyond the plant dies from lack of water. This fast fix will show you how to install the following sprinkler head: 1800 Series 12-inch Pop-Up PRS Sprinkler, 0-360° Pattern, Adjustable 8-15 ft. This will eliminate water waste and will spray water to areas you intend for the water to reach."
    },
